      "dda_id": "DMR000000037",
      "fields": {
        "relationship_code": "LegalEntityTransactionParty",
        "relationship_description": "A legal entity takes part in a transaction as a party to it, whether it pays or receives: the limited partner paying into a capital call, the fund receiving it, the fund paying for an acquisition, or the seller receiving the price. A transaction has several parties and a legal entity takes part in many transactions. The amount, purpose, direction and units for each party are held on the legs of the transaction. The date belongs to the transaction.",
